# Backend (functions / deploy) environment.
#
# The demo runs fully on the Firebase Emulator Suite with a project id that
# starts with "demo-", which needs no real credentials. You only touch this
# file when deploying to a real Blaze project.

# The real project id, when deploying. Leave the emulator default otherwise.
# GCLOUD_PROJECT=your-real-project-id

# When deploying, set a $1 budget alert in the Google Cloud console. Realistic
# demo cost is about $0. Documented so nobody is surprised by a bill.
